OL,3,GNEWSAThe veteran who travels the
OL,4,Acountry cleaning military graves
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the shadows of St John's Church, 240
OL,7,Falmost identical military gravestones
OL,8,Fare lined up in uniform rows. But most
OL,9,Fhave been untouched since they were
OL,10,Finstalled about 70 years ago.
OL,12,FMany are covered in black mould and
OL,13,Flichen, with others wonky or falling
OL,14,Fapart - until this week.
OL,16,FA group of veterans and community
OL,17,Fvolunteers at the church in Sharow,
OL,18,Fnear Ripon, have worked to clean the
OL,19,Fmemorials, taught by qualified
OL,20,Fstonemason and former soldier Steve
OL,21,FDavies.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
