OL,3,GNEWSAThe veteran who travels the
OL,4,Acountry cleaning military graves
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 68-year-old, who served with the
OL,7,FRoyal Green Jackets (RGJ) infantry
OL,8,Fregiment, has spent his retirement so
OL,9,Ffar travelling across the British
OL,10,FIsles, finding "forgotten military
OL,11,Fgraves".
